From c6563519e497bb95b5a32421e8ef1f8a3dea2946 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:51:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] ci: remove the uncovered test steps the 3.12 lane used

With one covered 3.14 lane the '!matrix.coverage' steps (ordinary,
timing-sensitive, long-run proof) can never run. They are removed and
the workflow contract tests now assert their absence and count one
pytest step per job. actionlint clean; tests/unit/cicd and
test_ci_workflow_xdist: 1385 passed together with the lint tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Szt2FzuKZ4Y8WpNigvatoY
